window.products.push({"id":703007,"name":"Blue Ridge Mountain Gifts Laser-Engraved Cherry Wood Cutting Board - Father's Day Gift, Rustic Farmhouse Decor, Ideal Wine-Inspired Gift for Wine Love","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Uy7a2FfXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LASER ENGRAVED MULTI-USE CUTTING BOARD: Tired of the same old, boring cheese board? Well, us too. This medium-sized (12\" X 9\" X .75\") cheese board is skillfully laser engraved to add some uniqueness. This can be used as a meal prep station, cutting board in your kitchen, a garnishing platter, and a great accent to your table for any party. CHERRY WOOD MADE: This cutting board is specifically made with cherry wood, that is long-lasting and durable with attractive colors and straight grains. It is a lightweight wood which makes it easy to clean and handle. Take it on a road trip, picnic, or home when entertaining guests. Use your board for farmhouse decor, wedding decor, or even a rustic decor theme. TOP QUALITY TO LAST: This engraved cutting board's edges are carefully sanded down and crafted with durability to last. We engrave and ship only the best cherry wood, which includes a 2oz resealable mineral oil for the cutting board to keep it in excellent shape. Beeswax, lemon oil, orange oil, and vitamin E are used to make the oil. This must-have oil is included at no extra cost with your board! AWESOME GIFT: Our medium-sized cherry wood cutting board is ideal for your home. Any food enthusiast will love having this around to prep fruits, veggies, and more! Great gift for dad and mom's birthdays, wedding gifts, anniversaries, housewarming gifts, and more. Even that hard-to-find engagement gift is no longer a problem. It's ideal for wine-inspired gift-giving and a spoof of great fun for wine enthusiasts on any occasion, with an engraving of the periodic table of wine! ABOUT US: Blue Ridge Mountain Gifts is a growing company specializing in personalized gifts and home decor products. We offer high-quality products like this cutting board at a competitive price while providing superior service and the best possible customer experience. Our cutting boards are made in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Uy7a2FfXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Ridge Mountain Gifts","source_asin":"B0BZFN2B4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZFN2B4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZFN2B4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
