window.products.push({"id":703064,"name":"Ziruma Set of 2 Ceramic Coffee Mugs with American Walnut Spoons and Large White Oak Saucers. Gift for Couples, Housewarming, Engagement & Weddings. Id","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oOHDv8WxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Complete Coffee Set: Our set includes 2 stoneware mugs, 2 American walnut spoons, and 2 large white oak saucers, perfect for sharing your morning coffee or tea with a loved one. Natural and Safe Materials: Crafted from natural elements, our mugs, spoons, and saucers are free of cadmium, lead, BPA, phthalates and petroleum-based mineral oil, ensuring your health and safety. Perfect Gift: Our coffee set makes a thoughtful and practical gift for housewarming, weddings, birthdays, and anniversaries. It's sure to impress any coffee or tea drinker. Eco-Friendly Packaging: We care about the environment and our packaging is 100% plastic-free. Our set comes beautifully packaged and ready to give as a gift. Stylish and Elegant Design: Our speckled white stoneware mugs and matching spoons and saucers add a touch of elegance to any coffee or tea time. The Ceramic mugs are safe for microwave and dishwasher. Ceramic is well-known for being an excellent thermal insulator as well as being super durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oOHDv8WxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ziruma","source_asin":"B0BQJT4CHT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQJT4CHT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQJT4CHT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":703065,"name":"Loch Ness Dye","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TyY8QAHLL._AC_.jpg","description":"Brandt Loch Ness S.S. Super Strength Blue Black Lake and Pond Colorant Brandt Loch Ness S.S. Super Strength The use of BRANDT LOCH NESS SS adds a natural beauty to ponds, lakes, fountains and lagoons, coloring them a natural, beautiful blue/black deep water hue. Brandt Loch Ness SS Blue Green Lake and Pond Colorant is a super strength formula that adds a natural looking blue/black deep water hue to improve appearances of lakes, ponds, lagoons and fountains. Brandt Loch Ness SS is safe for wildlife and humans and will not stain fish or birds. Swimming, fishing and irrigation is safe to do with this product in but NOT UNTIL the product has dispersed thoroughly. Please Note: Brandt's SS (Super Strength) formula is 4 times concentrated and 1 quart. is comparable to a gallon size of other conventional dyes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TyY8QAHLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brandt","source_asin":"B000P8AOSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000P8AOSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000P8AOSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":703066,"name":"Le Creuset Essential Enameled Cast-Iron 5-Piece Cookware Set, Kiwi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BTGMqHunL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description A thoughtful gift idea for newlyweds or anyone setting up a first-time kitchen, this five-piece cookware set from Le Creuset provides three commonly used pieces for everyday cooking. The assortment consists of a 1-1/4-quart precision-pour saucepan with lid, a 3-1/2-quart round French oven with lid, and a 9-inch iron-handle skillet. Use the saucepan for making homemade marinara, the French oven for cooking vegetable soup or a slew of chili, and the skillet for making grilled cheese sandwiches, silver-dollar pancakes, and more--its wide cooking surface and gently curved sides make it easy to flip food before sliding it gracefully from the pan to a plate. As part of Le Creuset's line of enameled cast iron, the cookware's exterior features a colorful, long-lasting enamel that resists chipping and cracking, while its durable, nonreactive sand-colored enamel interior offers a smooth surface for cooking and an optimal palette for food presentation (the iron-handle skillet comes with a satin black interior). As cast iron is unexcelled for even heat distribution and superior heat retention, and enamel is impervious to acids and odors, the pieces cook food uniformly and gently without hot spots and can be used for marinating, cooking on the stovetop, or finishing in the oven. Thoughtfully designed, the saucepan provides a rounded handle and opposite helper handle; the French oven offers two loop side handles, and the skillet comes with an iron handle with an opposite helper handle--as well as two nondrip spouts for convenient mess-free pouring. Both the French oven and the saucepan supply tight-fitting lids, each with a phenolic knob that stays cool on the stovetop and can withstand an oven's heat to 350 degrees F. Though dishwasher-safe, the cookware should be hand washed for best results. What's in the Box 5-piece cookware set. The set includes: 1-1/4-quart saucepan with lid; 3-1/2-quart round French oven with lid; 9-inch iron-handle skillet. 5 pieces total. Amazon.com Le Creuset combines three of its most commonly-used, cast-iron cookware items in this excellent gift set. Included are a 3-1/2-quart round French oven with lid; 1-1/4-quart precision-pour lidded saucepan with phenolic handle; and 9-inch skillet with helper handle and two pour spouts. Each heavy piece is coated with hard porcelain enamel for superior performance, and is attractive and durable enough to go straight from the stovetop or oven to the table. You'll find the small saucepan ideal for whisking sauces and heating soup; the French oven perfect for baking casseroles and meats; and the skillet a charm for sautéing fish or making the perfect omelet. Le Creuset is known for suffusing the exterior of its products with bright, modern colors, while keeping a more neutral tone on the interior to showcase the cuisine. The enamel resists cracking and staining and is best cared for when the contents are stirred with nylon, wood, or silicone utensils. It's also so smooth that food particles tend not to stick, making cleaning by hand or in the dishwasher a snap. Made in France, Le Creuset premium cookware brings joie de vivre to any kitchen it graces and is covered by a lifetime warranty, whether you bought the item for yourself or received it as a gift. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 5-piece cookware set. The set includes: 1-1/4-quart saucepan with lid; 3-1/2-quart round French oven with lid; 9-inch iron-handle skillet. 5 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BTGMqHunL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B000U3DMFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000U3DMFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000U3DMFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
