window.products.push({"id":703112,"name":"Flexible Molds - Pine Tree Christmas Tree (20 cavity) - Cream Cheese Mint Molds - Candy Melts - Fondant - Caramels - Soft Candy Molds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wXgisBq+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Edelaines Flexible Molds are made for Soft Candies like - Cream Cheese Mints - Candy Melts - Chocolate - Fondant - Gummies - Caramels - Fat Bombs Soft Candies require a flexible mold to easily remove the candy from the mold. Our molds are perfect for these types of candies. Molds are made from a medical-grade polymer which is food safe. This polymer allows the mold to remain flexible and easy to use, unlike silicone molds which tend to be more rigid. We recommend hand washing with mild soap and pat dry for years and years of use. Dishwasher is not recommended due to the higher drying temperatures. --Not Recommended for Microwave Use --Caution for years of use never put any product that is over 245° Fahrenheit into the flexible mold. Candies that are NOT suitable for our molds are hard candies, rock candy, and any candy that exceeds the 245° Fahrenheit limitation. Please note hard candies require temperatures of 300° Fahrenheit making them unsuitable for our molds. Made in the USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wXgisBq+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Edelaines LLC","source_asin":"B07Z8MZHGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z8MZHGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z8MZHGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":703113,"name":"Serta Willow Futon Mattress, Queen, Meadow Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819JqbFPiVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wolf Corporation is the oldest Serta licensee, proud to say we are the sole manufacturer of Serta Futon Mattresses! Serta Futon Mattresses feature Cottonique. Cottonique combines selected grades of cotton with polyester fibers for a unique, durable upholstery blend that outperforms and outlasts traditional cotton batting. As a result Serta futons are more resilient, more comfortable and yet surprisingly light. The Willow is comprised of a core of \"Storm\", Wolf's cotton poly bonded pad that serves as a foam replacement pad. In addition there are 2 layers of finger foam, a layer of polyurethane foam and a layer of visco foam surrounded by Wolf's heavy weight cotton fiber blend fo conforming comfort. The Serta Willow is a 9\" mattress built for years of comfort. Machine lace tufts and true box casing construction complete the Willow. This Willow futon mattress is covered in a meadow green upholstery grade fabric and is full size, 54\" x 75\". All Serta Futon mattresses are compressed, rolled and boxed which makes for ease in shipping and installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819JqbFPiVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOLF","source_asin":"B004B8U4HQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004B8U4HQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004B8U4HQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":703114,"name":"Crystal Allies Gallery: Set of 10 Assorted 1.5\" to 2\" Natural & Dyed Agate Druzy Thin Pendant Slices w/ 2mm Drilled Hole","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613NHtwtE1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Agate is a stone that transmits strength, creativity, protection, and courage onto its owners. It strengthens both physically and mentally. As it applies energy to different counterparts, it qualifies one of its most important attributes, which is to balance yin and yang energy. Although it assists in increasing energy, it does so only as needed. In this way, Agate acts as a conservative stone, applying its elements only when necessary. For individuals who need a boost, Agate is a useful stone as it offers courage and emotional strength while dispelling fear and envy. As Agate heals, it strengthens the body's connection to the earth and harmonizes its various elements. In Ancient times, Agate was found in the river Achetes in Sicily, which is where it gets its name. The stone was used before 3000 B.C. by the early Egyptians, and in jewelry in Ancient India. Agates acted as the foundation of the German stonecutting and polishing industry which boomed in popularity during the fifteenth through nineteenth centuries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613NHtwtE1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crystal Allies","source_asin":"B00DPP7HPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DPP7HPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DPP7HPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
