window.products.push({"id":703158,"name":"La Rochere Soleil 9-1/2-Ounce Goblet Glass, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Pfh+rm3PL._AC_.jpg","description":"La Rochere, located in France, is the oldest continuous running glass factory in Europe. Opened in 1475 (17 years before Columbus came to the Americas, La Rochere has been producing glass. Each item is machine made in France at very high temperatures producing a glass the is both crystal clear and durable.. This heavy duty glass is sturdy and perfect for everyday use. It is both casual and elegant and dishwasher safe. The many embossed decors include the Napoleon bee, French royal Fleur de Lys, Dragonfly representing spring and rebirth, Versailles, which is developed from the palace at Versailles, or Perigord, the traditional lines and clarity from the Bordeaux region, each piece is a piece of French glass history.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Pfh+rm3PL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"La Rochere","source_asin":"B003NCWJ0Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003NCWJ0Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003NCWJ0Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":703159,"name":"Portable Blender for Shakes and Smoothies, OBERLY Upgraded Personal Blender for Protein with USB Rechargeable, Crush Ice, Frozen Fruit and Drinks, 13o","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nm8ou4qfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our OBERLY portable blender 2 delivers game-changing technology that lets you make shakes, smoothies, or mixed drinks wherever you go. Super convenient self-clean function, forget about dirty cups, and just enjoy the drinks! Powerful & Stronger Motor The powerful motor could speed up to 18000 rpm/min. It's easy to crush ice, frozen fruit, leafy greens and more into smoothies within 30 seconds flat. Perfect for protein shake, milkshake, juice, smoothies. Unique Drink Spout From our ergonomic design to our fast-flowing drink spout and leak-proof lid, every part of our blender is designed with you in mind! The juicer cup with food grade material don’t impact taste and boast a built-in lanyard strap so you can take it on the go. 6-Point Stainless Steel Blades Our laser-cut blades are designed to deliver the same quality results, from first blend to last, and are resistant to dulling or bending, fold food back to the blades for consistently faster smooth blending—creating the vortex. Specification: Rated Power: 175 watts Working Voltage: 7.4V Charging Voltage/Current: 5V/1A Motor Speed: 18000 rpm Blade Material: 6-point stainless steel blades Cup Material: PCTG Food Grade (BPA free) Capacity: 13oz Blender Dimensions: 3.3x3.3x9” Pay attention to the following tips: If Indicator light is in red and unable to start, mean your blender is out of power. You need to charge your blender. If Indicator light flicker is in red and blue alternately and unable to start, mean the jar isn’t aligned with your base. To fix this, tighten the jar and base, make sure the magnet is align with the power button. If Indicator light flicker is in red and stop working, mean the blades are blocked. You should cut your fruit into small chunks or shake your blender while blending.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nm8ou4qfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OBERLY","source_asin":"B086SCWM84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086SCWM84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086SCWM84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":703160,"name":"VERCART Soft Reading Pillow for Adult, Long Bed Rest Back Support Cushion for Pregnancy, Extra Large Headboard Sitting Up Pillow for Watching TV, Gami","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mNv3imrJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size: Twin (39x3x20 Inches); PERFECT READING PILLOW: With a rectangular shape cushion, this comfortable bedside reading pillow functions perfectly to provide soft back support as a lumbar pillow when you sit up on bed for reading, watching TV, browsing phone, surfing tablet, playing video games, exercising yoga, breastfeeding and resting after surgery. COMFORTABLE BODY PILLOW: As a large body pillow, it replaces all normal bed rest or lumbar pillows, creates multi-positions as a positioner pillow to support back,shoulder, spine,stomach, legs and allows your muscles stay relaxed. Promotes an aligned spine for any sleeper whether you need a upholstered bedrest pillow or a large back support cushion,if you just need more or less loft. You may also use it as a pregnancy pillow that provides different body part support and release pregnant pains. ORIGINALLY DESIGNED WITH HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS: The rectangular reading pillow come with three dimensional stripes, fabric button tufts, fully hemmed edges are the very disinguishing among all other normal backrest pillows. Though the back support throw decorative pillow is soft , it still maintains its supportive shape by taking the full advantage of the resilient and flexible micro polyester fiberfill. The two-way zipper of bedside cushion, which is very strong and durable for long-term use. BEAUTIFUL BEDSIDE DECORATIVE PILLOW: If you need a quick and easy headboard, this upholstery headboard reading pillow can be used as an alternative replacement while being a beautiful bed decor. Its elegant design will add an inviting view to your bedroom. With its attractive appearance, this original bedside back rest padd is adjustable for bedroom, hotel,hospital, window seat, couch, sofa, daybed, bunk bed, dorm bed, platform bed. REMOVABLE LUMBAR PILLOW COVER & EASY TO WASH: You can easily remove the bed rest bloster pillow cover by opening the zipper and unlooping the buttons from the reading pillow cover and get it machine washed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mNv3imrJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VERCART","source_asin":"B0914PTPY4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0914PTPY4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0914PTPY4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
