window.products.push({"id":703455,"name":"wtynmrr2 Anniversary Flower Gift for Her, Birthday Gifts for Mom,Romantic Gifts for Women Girlfriend Mom Wife, Valentines Mothers Day Christmas Flower","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71URt5C0ypL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[I Love You Gifts for Her]: Three roses means “I love You\". A necklace with 100 kinds of \"I love you\" language is attached to the small drawer of the gift box. This 3 roses box is a wonderful gift for mom, girlfriend, wife,women, daughters, sisters, friends or other special lady in your life on Valentine's Day, Wedding, Engagement, Mothers Day, Anniversary day, Birthday, Thanksgiving and Christmas. [Sentimental Gifts for Mom]: Since Mother's Day is about celebrating moms of all kinds, our 3 rose box with I love you necklace is a simple gift to communicate you care to your mom, grandmas, mother-in-laws, stepmoms or godmothers as mothers day gifts, mom gifts, grandma gifts, thank you gifts, mothers day gifts for sister, nana gifts or aunt gifts. [Unique Birthday Gifts for Her]:Most wemen like to celebrate their birthday no matter how old she is. The flower gift is the best choice as birthday gifts for women mom sister girlfriend grandma or wife no matter on their 18th, 21st, 30th, 40th, 50th, 60th, or 70th birthday. [Romantic Anniversary Gift for Her]: No matter how long you've been dating or married, anniversaries are always a special occasion.This 3 rose box with I love you necklace is a thoughtful anniversary gift for her that she’ll cherish forever.Great anniversary gift for wife, girlfriend, fiancee, or partner no matter on 1 year, 2 year, 4 year, 5 year, 10 year, 15th, 25th, 50th anniverasary day. How to see the 100 languages: In a well-lit environment, bring the front side of the stone in the center of the necklace close to your eyes. Or go to a dark area with little to no light ,turn on the phone camera and point the camera at the front side of stone. You will see 100 languages on the screen","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71URt5C0ypL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wtynmrr2","source_asin":"B0B9GHYKL1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9GHYKL1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9GHYKL1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":703456,"name":"NOVICA Dark Red Hand Woven Alpaca Blend Throw Blanket, 'Crimson Passion'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8147ChZ71rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Carrying on the textile traditions of Peru's Puno region, native artisan Nestor Yana is proud to present his own designs in this throw blanket, which features a textured pattern and a solid crimson color. Woven from an acrylic and alpaca wool blend, the warm, durable throw is finished with fringes on the ends.   Blanket dimensions: 63.0\" L x 50.0\" W   Fringe: 3.7\" L  - Lay flat to dry - Machine wash in cold water   About our Artist: Nestor Yana hails from Peru's Puno region renowned for quality alpaca and sheep wool. When he first began to weave, he worked on the rustic looms he built along with other family members. They sold their wares at local markets until they were able to acquire modern machinery, which in turn allowed them to develop newer designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8147ChZ71rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01NALXHHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NALXHHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NALXHHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
