window.products.push({"id":703508,"name":"MATIRISE PVC Heat Shrink Capsules 150 Pcs Wine Shrink Wrap Seals Sleeves Caps,Clear Wine Bottle Corks Tops Stopper with Tear Tab,Professional Wine Mak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gWxSXrDbL._AC_SL1444_.jpg","description":"EASY and CONVENIENT to USE：Shrink capsules are very convenient to use, in the absence of professional heat shrink machine, you can use the boiling water method(see step-by-step guide among the pictures). These shrink sleeves are easy to open as well. It comes with tear-off tabs. VERY VERSATILE：Wine bottle shrink capsule is suitable for most different bottles, nice for home and kitchen using. These shrink sleeves are also suitable for wine cellar, party favors, or as a practical gift for the wine collection lovers. DIFFERENT COLORS：3 colors are provided for you, includes gold, silver and navy blue(glossy high-end color scheme), different colors will give your wine bottles different feeling, you can also use different colored shrink capsules to distinguish different red wines. HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS：MATIRISE Heat Shrink Capsules made of PVC, safe and non-toxic, you can use them safely. Spanish, French and Italian wineries mostly use these capsules for their bottles. DECORATION and PROTECTION：Wine capsules help to seal wine bottles and decorate empty wine bottles, not only will they give your wine bottles an elegant and professional look, these pvc shrink capsules are also great for preventing water, moisture, and dust, protect your wine from spoiling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gWxSXrDbL._AC_SL1444_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MATIRISE","source_asin":"B09XQ4QF5N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XQ4QF5N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XQ4QF5N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
