window.products.push({"id":703546,"name":"Nice-live Silicone Cake Pop Mold 2 Pack, Baking Molds for Cocoa Bombs Chocolate Cake Candy Mousse Jelly Pudding, Valentine's Day Gift (Small, Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lm1Ppzh6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TIPS: When you make the chocolate, please do not pure full chocolate raw material into the silicone half ball, just make it 3/4 full. When you get the hot cocoa bomb mold and the first time to make cake or chocolate, please fill the water in it and put it into the microwave or oven transfer for 1-2 minutes at first. Please do not use cool water to clean immediately when it's just taken out of the oven. SPECIFICATIONS: Material: Food Grade Silicone Color: Brown, Coffee, Purple, Yellow, Green Package Contents: Hot Chocolate Silicone × 2 SERVICE: The molds has a half year warranty. When contacting us with related issues, the best solution will be given to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lm1Ppzh6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nice-live","source_asin":"B08PK5L3HX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PK5L3HX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PK5L3HX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
