window.products.push({"id":703613,"name":"60th Birthday Decorations Kit 79 Pieces – Happy Birthday Banner, 40-Inch 60 Gold balloons, Sparkling Hanging Swirls, Photo Booth Props, 60th Birthday ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IWdfrmvNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WE ARE CONFIDENT IN OUR PRODUCTS SO DO NOT MISS A CHANCE TO MAKE YOUR 60TH BIRTHDAY DECORATIONS MORE LOVABLE AND MEMORABLE. You Will Get 79 Pieces 60th Birthday Decorations Kit Includes: 13 Piece Birthday Banner with Gold Letters on Black Background. Flag size: approx 16 * 20 cm / 6.3” * 7.9”. The HAPPY banner measures approx. 1.6 m / 5.3 ft , the BIRTHDAY banner measures approx. 2.4 m / 7.9 ft. 16 Sparkling Celebration 60 Birthday Hanging Swirls as shown. 24 Unisex 60th Birthday Party Photo Booth Props. Easy to DIY, comes with bamboo sticks and double-sided adhesive you need to assemble the photo booth props in a few short minutes. 6 Foil Balloons. - 40” gold number 60 foil balloons, 4 18” gold and black star foil balloons.  - Foil balloons use best sealing technology for longer lasting seal with a seamless beautiful appearance and helium support. 18 12” Latex Balloons. - Gold silver and black, each 6 of each color.  - Helium Supported.  - Balloons can filled with air or helium, but Inflate with air is highly recommended.  - Gold latex balloons look orange when flat, when inflated gold; There is some powder on the surface of the balloons in order to prevent adhesion. A Pack of Number 60 and Star Confetti. - 2400 Piece approx gold silver black number 60 ( approx 15 mm / 0.6 inch ) and gold silver star ( approx 10 mm / 0.4 inch ) confetti.  - High luster: This “60” and “star” confetti is made of PVC. They also have high luster and color retention, smooth and bling surface. 2 Pieces 10 Meters Gold Ribbon. YOU ARE ONLY 60 YEARS OLD ONCE, MAKE IT THE BEST ONE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IWdfrmvNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TopBashGo","source_asin":"B076CQBX7B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076CQBX7B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076CQBX7B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
