window.products.push({"id":703637,"name":"GOOD & GRACIOUS Beige Full Size Bed Frame, Platform Bed with Upholstered & Tufted Headboard and Frame with Storage Drawers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":204.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611MyfdtlsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ACCOMMODATES STANDARD FULL SIZE MATTRESS: With overall dimensions of 75\"L x 57\"W x 42\"H, this platform bed will accept a standard full size mattress that is 53\"W x 74.5\"L. This full size bed frame features a tall headboard which is ideal for use with thicker mattresses. TWO STORAGE DRAWERS: One of the best features of this platform bed is the storage drawers which are located underneath the footboard. Not only do these storage drawers provide a beneficial space to keep extra bed linens and pillows, they are on rolling casters so it's easy to slide them in and out of the bed frame. DESIGNER TUFTED HEADBOARD: Upholstered in beige linen look fabric, this platform bed will be a striking centerpiece in your bedroom. The headboard has a diamond shaped tufted pattern which is complimented with button details for classic styling. The taller stature of the 30\"H headboard is the perfect backdrop for colorful accent pillows to complete the look. FRAMEWORK WITH FABRIC UPHOLSTERY: Complete with upholstered drawer fronts, side rails and footboard, this platform bed with storage coordinates well with modern bed linen styles that allow the upholstered frame to be exposed for a contemporary look. PLATFORM FRAME FOR SUPPORT WITHOUT A BOXSPRING: If your mattress has a higher profile, this platform bed can be used without a box spring. The horizontal slats provide a firm and stable surface for the mattress of your choice. Thinner mattresses may require the use of a box spring to fit at the proper height.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611MyfdtlsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOOD & GRACIOUS","source_asin":"B0B38JV3QV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B38JV3QV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B38JV3QV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
