window.products.push({"id":703642,"name":"Kitchen Rugs Mats 2 Pieces, Colorful Chili Pepper Cushioned Kitchen Mat Anti-Fatigue Comfort Floor Mat Non Slip Kitchen Rug Standing Mats for Kitchen,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8133QWP+eJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The kitchen mat made by us is well known for its high quality, excellent design and exclamatory craft. We regard continuous innovation and produce high quality carpet as the highest goal. SPECIFICATION: 1.Material: Thick polyester, PVC granular bottom and velvet edging 2.Size: 20x47 Inch and 20*28 Inch 3.Package included: 2 x modern kitchen rug mat 4.Style: Modern/fashion/unique/interesting FEATURE: 1.This kitchen rug is water absorption and oil stain resistant, keep your kitchen dry. 2.Slip resistant: it can ensure you have a safe activity and non-skid backing keeps the rug in place and protects the floor. 3.Durable and stylish, sturdy edge stitching keep the rug mat in original good condition after multiple wash and longtime use. Fashion pattern design upgrade home and kitchen decor. 4.Soft mats suitable for indoor/outdoor door mats, kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, living room, dining room, office, porch, stairs, balcony, kid's room etc. How to clean our floor mats? The strong fiber ensures the washable kitchen rugs' durability. Just spray off with a hose or use mild detergent to clean off dirt. Let it air dry after you settle it flat. What’s more, the rug’s color will not fade with continual uses. Machine wash is not recommended. What should I do if the received rug has creases? Please place it for 3-5 hours, the crease will disappear. If there are still slight creases after being left for a few hours, you can put a cloth on the rug and iron it with an iron, the creases will disappear completely. What should I do if the rug slides on the floor? Due to the different floor materials, the friction between the rug and the floor is also different. You only need to lay a piece of plastic wrap on the floor and cover it with a rug, the rug will be fixed. Generally, the rug are used in most floor materials and will not move.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8133QWP+eJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"susiyo","source_asin":"B09FT4SD1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FT4SD1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FT4SD1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
