window.products.push({"id":703724,"name":"Set Of Four Square Plastic Serving Bowls With Spoons – Two Large (64 oz) and Two Medium (32 oz) Bowls – Perfect For Your Party or Event – and Durable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P1aQeyiWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Perfect Serving Bowls For Your Party or Event Whether you’re hosting a small gathering of friends at home, or putting on a big event like a wedding or a conference, good serving bowls are absolutely essential. These white plastic bowls are both beautiful and practical. The shape of the bowls also means that your food will be presented incredibly beautifully, as the eye is drawn towards the contents of the bowl. This set comes with four bowls, two large and two medium, so you can serve your guests a range of different dishes. Comes With A Set Of Serving Spoons Each bowl comes with a set of silver plastic serving spoons. Unlike some flimsy disposable spoons that could break in your guests’ hands, these spoons are capable of picking up any dishes that you serve - even heavy foods like pasta. Each bowl comes with one round spoon, and one forked spoon. This makes it perfect for easily mixing and serving salads. Made From Durable Hard Plastic Both the bowls and the spoons are made from the highest quality hard plastic. The bowls come in white plastic, and the spoons are silver. The plastic has been tested to be durable, so it won’t smash, crack, or let you down when you need it most. 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed We stand behind the quality of all of our products. If you aren’t completely satisfied with these bowls and serving spoons, then just send them back to us for a full refund. You can inspect them yourself in your home, risk free. Pick Up These Bowls Today and Make Your Next Party The Best Ever","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P1aQeyiWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"silver collection","source_asin":"B072HZV1KC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072HZV1KC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072HZV1KC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
