window.products.push({"id":703764,"name":"Stoclet Frieze by Gustav Klimt ?? Stoclet Frieze Series | Woven Tapestry Wall Art Hanging | Tree of Life Wisdom | 100% Cotton USA Size 53x34","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":160.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CNFyVvXwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Stoclet Frieze is a series of three mosaics created by Austrian Symbolist painter Gustav Klimt for a 1905-1911 commission for the Palais Stoclet in Brussels. The separate panels depict swirling trees of life, a lone standing female figure and an embracing couple. In his works, Klimt's primary subject was the female body, and his works are marked by a frank eroticism. Our artisans have woven these three classic paintings into one vividly bold textile interpretation. A fine wall tapestry showcasing Klimt's use of geometric shapes, brilliant color palette, and intricate detail. A masterpiece for your living space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CNFyVvXwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pure Country Weavers","source_asin":"B00112RWTI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00112RWTI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00112RWTI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
