window.products.push({"id":703848,"name":"ALTUNBULAK | Turkish Beach Towel 100% Cotton Towel, 39x70 Inches Highly Absorbent, Quick-Drying, Lightweight, Soft Feeling, Peshtemal for Bath, Beach,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1WbOXF7AnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TURKISH COTTON TOWEL WITH UNIQUE HANDWORK Whether you're heading to the beach, enjoying a spa day, or just taking your morning shower, you'll need a quality towel that will add luxury to you for any occasion.   Who wouldn't want a quality towel that you can carry comfortably in your suitcase on travels, with its hand embroidery, vibrant colors and elegance.. FEATURES Compact for Easy Travel; Conveniently compact, our lightweight beach towel is great for travel. Fold it up small to maximize luggage space, or carry it solo on your next outdoor adventure. Essential for backpacking, hiking or simple sunbathing, you can use it as a picnic blanket, camping towel or cover up. Super Absorbent; From swimming to showering, Wetcat Turkish beach towels are famously absorbent. It’s all thanks to a unique weaving technique, which allows them to instantly soak up water and other liquids. A great alternative to standard pool towels, kids won’t track puddles through the house. Luxuriously Soft; Made with the highest quality cotton Turkey has to offer, our oversized beach towel is as luxurious as it is functional. Each one is prewashed for minimal shrinkage, resulting in a silky smooth texture and cloud-like softness. At first, it may feel different from what you’re used to, but you’ll soon see there’s no turning back. Quick-Drying; Thinner than terry towels, Turkish bathroom towels are incredibly quick-drying, making them less prone to annoying smell. Not only does this save time, it also reduces washer and dryer use. In fact, washing 4 Turkish bath sheets uses less water and energy than washing a single terry cloth towel. Premium Turkish Cotton Beach Towel; With The Highest quality premium cotton from Turkey, our oversized beach towel makes difference in terms of feeling. Once","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1WbOXF7AnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALTUNBULAK","source_asin":"B0B1LFSDJR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1LFSDJR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1LFSDJR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
