window.products.push({"id":703851,"name":"Manual Can Opener, 3-in-1 Atpot Stainless Steel Can Bottle Openers with Smooth Edge, Ultra Sharp Jar opener with Anti Slip and Ergonomic Hand Grip + E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KYX-ZMf+L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"★ Why choose our manual can opener? ➤Our can openers are made of high quality, high quality materials that are corrosion resistant and easy to clean. ➤Multi-function can opener for all sizes of cans, manual can openers, can be used as a bottle opener. ➤ Opener manual side cutting mechanism will provide smooth edges for the can opener, ensuring that your hands are very safe. ➤ Opener An ergonomic, non-slip handle gives you extra strength to cut the lid with long, sharp wheels. The large knob ensures easy rotation. How multifunctional is the can opener? -lever, pry the can lids. -can opener, take off the can lids. -bottle opener, open the beer. How to rinse off and store after using? 1-The can opener is easy to clean. Wash it in warm water with a little detergent by hand or just put it under running water.  2-Dishwasher is also safe. Wipe off the water after cleaning or air dry in case of getting rust. ★ HOW TO USE ? ➤Step 1:Open handles and insert the blade into the edge of the can. Clamp the can with gears and blades tightly.  ➤Step 2:Rotate the knob in a clockwise direction. Turn the can clockwise.  ➤Step 3:Open the handle and remove the lid.  ★ Tip: Do not open the lid completely to prevent the lid from falling on the food. Specification ●Material: stainless steel metal+ ABS plastic handle + 3CR13 blade  ●Gross weight:7.6 oz ●Color: black ●Usage: open cans, jars and bottles Package included: -3-in-1 Can Opener x1  -Extra Bottle Opener x1 Note： 1.Pay attention to the sharp blade in case of hurting. Keep it out of kids’ reach. 2.The sharp opened lid may hurt you. Keep it away from kids. 3.Clean the tin opener and dry it after cleaning. The high quality stainless steel blade will never rust.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KYX-ZMf+L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Atpot","source_asin":"B082Z3N5M7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-703851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082Z3N5M7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082Z3N5M7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
